                4. Zero-sum subsequences of zero-sum sequences
   In [9], Gao et.al. considered a problem on short zero-sum subsequences of zero-
sum sequences over finite abelian groups. For more, one can see [27]. In this section,
we study a problem on zero-sum subsequences of length ≤ k in zero-sum sequences
over finite abelian p-groups. This problem is useful for the determination of s≤k (G)
in next section.
   We will use the following lemmas repeatly.
